  "body": "I don't think it's required for web compat.  Gecko only does this for navigations and `<object>` (things that can end up with a browsing context).  Specifically, about:blank stylesheets are cross-origin in Gecko, and you can't XHR to about:blank in either Gecko or Blink (but can in WebKit, apparently).\n",
